trics writes cost_attribution_gap_pct, the share of the paid AI Gateway list cost of the last 7 days that has no ai_spend_ledger row (per provider and the models with the largest cost in cloud_ops_events cost-attribution-<day>; 98.7% on 2026-10-06, most of it a Node client with no cf-aig-metadata); cmRequeueStale hands a stale task that parked its SEARCH/REPLACE edits back to code-task-publish (status ready_to_publish, branch <branch>-r2) for a rebuild on current main without a model call (REBASE-BEFORE-PUBLISH-1), once, before re-proposing; numbered above main's 0.4.138 (main took 0.4.135 to 0.4.138 while this change was open: PRs 699, 707, 709). 0.4.138 CRAWL-HEALTH-1: Googlebot sitemap and error view from the zone request log, self-filing and self-closing; 0.4.137 SEARCH-REFERRALS-1: search_referrals_30d and google_referrals_30d from Cloudflare RUM referrers each reach tick; 0.4.136 metric column fix; 0.4.135 GOOGLE-IDENTITY-DETECT-1: the reach tick resolves the owner Google card from public DNS; 0.4.134 W0-LEADING-EXIT-1 (2026-10-06, pillar autonomy, docs/TRANSFORMATION-PROGRAM.md 1.2 T1 lever 16): wave W0 exits on code_task_success_rate_engine, the success rate (merged over finished, the formula of code_task_success_rate_30d) of code tasks created after lever (1, 15) MERGE-SCOPE-INTAKE-1 landed, measured only once at least TP_ENGINE_MIN_FINISHED (8) have finished; the 42 closures of 2026-10-02..10-05 stay in the 30-day window until November whatever the engine does now, so W0 measured the past. code_task_success_rate_30d keeps its scoreboard row and its trigger. 0.4.133 SCORER-HOST-DENY-1 (2026-10-06, pillar autonomy, docs/TRANSFORMATION-PROGRAM.md 1.2 section 1.12): EVOLVE_DENY (so CM_DENY) and TP_CONTROL_PLANE name qnfo-observability. qnfo-autonomy-scorer was denied so that no loop merges a change to the formula that grades the fleet; SCORER-FOLD-1 (PR 668) moved that code into qnfo-observability, which the merge runner and the planner then accepted. A FOLDED